{0 Pango modules}

{!Ocpango} has one module for each Pango class, interface and record. The externals they are built on are in {!Ocpango.Raw}.

{1 Classes}

{!modules:
  Ocpango.Context
  Ocpango.Coverage
  Ocpango.Font
  Ocpango.Font_face
  Ocpango.Font_family
  Ocpango.Font_map
  Ocpango.Fontset
  Ocpango.Fontset_simple
  Ocpango.Layout
  Ocpango.Renderer
}

